{'symbol': 'GS', 'date': '2021-03-25 17:19:00', 'title': 'GOLDMAN SACHS ASSET MANAGEMENT CLOSED-END FUND ANNOUNCES RESULTS OF ANNUAL SHAREHOLDER MEETING', 'text': "NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--GOLDMAN SACHS ASSET MANAGEMENT (“GSAM”), INVESTMENT ADVISER FOR THE GOLDMAN SACHS MLP AND ENERGY RENAISSANCE FUND (GER) (THE “FUND”), ANNOUNCED THE RESULTS FROM THE FUND'S ANNUAL SHAREHOLDER MEETING HELD TODAY. ELECTION OF TRUSTEE SHAREHOLDERS OF THE FUND ELECTED ONE CLASS III TRUSTEE, LAWRENCE W. STRANGHOENER. FOR ADDITIONAL INFORMATION, PLEASE VISIT THE FUND'S WEBSITE AT WWW.GSAMFUNDS.COM/CEF. THE FUND THE FUND IS A NON-DIVERSIFIED, CLOSED-END MANAGEMENT INVESTMENT"}